---

## Logo fayli

Logo kod ko‘rinishida emas, rasm fayl bo‘lishi kerak:

```text
attached_assets/omad-tour-logo.jpg
```

`vite.config.ts` shu faylni quyidagi import orqali oladi:

```tsx
import logoPath from '@assets/omad-tour-logo.jpg';
```

---

## Admin parol

Hozir admin parol mavjud emas:

```tsx
const configured = Boolean(
  import.meta.env.VITE_OMAD_ADMIN_PASSWORD,
);
```

Shuning uchun admin tugmasi hozir ishlamaydi. Parolni quyidagicha frontendga yozish tavsiya etilmaydi:

```env
VITE_OMAD_ADMIN_PASSWORD=some-password
```

Sababi `VITE_...` o‘zgaruvchilar build vaqtida brauzer kodiga qo‘shiladi va foydalanuvchi uni ko‘rishi mumkin.

To‘g‘ri variant:

```text
Frontend → serverdagi admin login endpointi
Server → Replit Secret ichidagi admin parol
```

Hozirgi loyiha faqat localStorage’da ishlaydi. Admin panel ham faqat localStorage’dagi murojaatlarni ko‘rsatadi; Telegram bot va server bazasi hali ulanmagan.
